 "CWO05": {
  "hits": 11,
  "rows": 10,
  "list": [
   {
    "row": "W1-005",
    "field": "boundary_rationale",
    "index": null,
    "text": "Robinson-Pierpont prints a pilcrow at 1:26, where this step begins."
   },
   {
    "row": "W1-010",
    "field": "boundary_rationale",
    "index": null,
    "text": "The step begins under an RP pilcrow at 3:10;"
   },
   {
    "row": "W1-010",
    "field": "boundary_rationale",
    "index": null,
    "text": "at 3:16 a fresh RP pilcrow coincides with the question formula that opens the temple image."
   },
   {
    "row": "W1-011",
    "field": "boundary_rationale",
    "index": null,
    "text": "Pilcrows in the RP text begin 3:16 and 3:18, the onset and the close of this short unit, where a prohibition against self-deception begins."
   },
   {
    "row": "W1-013",
    "field": "boundary_rationale",
    "index": null,
    "text": "At 4:6 a vocative and a first-person statement about applying these things to himself and Apollos open a new step, and the RP pilcrow at 4:6 falls at that turn."
   },
   {
    "row": "W3-006",
    "field": "boundary_rationale",
    "index": null,
    "text": "The row closes at 10:22 on the questions Ἢ παραζηλοῦμεν τὸν κύριον (rp:1Cor.10.22), and the RP pilcrow at 10:23 stands at the seam after it, where the slogan returns."
   },
   {
    "row": "W3-008",
    "field": "boundary_rationale",
    "index": null,
    "text": "Across the seam Ἐπαινῶ δὲ ὑμᾶς (rp:1Cor.11.2) opens a new subject with praise, and the RP pilcrow at 11:2 sits on that seam."
   },
   {
    "row": "W4-001",
    "field": "boundary_evidence_refs",
    "index": 0,
    "text": "rp:1Cor.11.2 [WARRANT-onset:near] (praise opening Ἐπαινῶ δὲ ὑμᾶς, with tradition vocabulary; RP pilcrow at 11:2 decides nothing)"
   },
   {
    "row": "W6-001",
    "field": "boundary_evidence_refs",
    "index": 5,
    "text": "rp:1Cor.15.12 (conditional opens the following argument; RP pilcrow)"
   },
   {
    "row": "W6-009",
    "field": "boundary_evidence_refs",
    "index": 6,
    "text": "rp:1Cor.16.13 (imperatives open the following unit; RP pilcrow)"
   },
   {
    "row": "W6-010",
    "field": "boundary_evidence_refs",
    "index": 4,
    "text": "rp:1Cor.16.15 (appeal formula opens the following unit; RP pilcrow)"
   }
  ]
 },
